==History==
2016
*The Barbarian Hut [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], increased the Barbarian Hut's hitpoints by 10%, but also decreased the [[Barbarians]]' hitpoints by 4%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March%202016%20Update%20(29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Barbarians' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level cap to 11 (from 10). The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Barbarians' range to 0.7 tiles (from 1.2 tiles), but their effective range was unchanged.
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], changed the Barbarian Hut's card description. It used to read “''Troop building that periodically deploys Barbarians to fight the enemy. Time to make the Barbarians.''”
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians‘ attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2019
*On 7/1/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Hut's hitpoints by 7%.
*On 4/3/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians' hitpoints by 13%.
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], added an extra [[Star Points|Star Level]].
2020
*On 4/2/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Hut’s lifetime to 50 seconds (from 60 seconds), decreased its spawn time interval to 12.5 seconds (from 13.5 seconds), and made it spawn 2 additional Barbarians upon death.
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Hut's hitpoints by 19.5%.
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Hut's hitpoints by 21%.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Barbarian Hut from Barbarian Bowl to Serenity Peak.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], decreased the hitpoints of the Barbarian Hut by 15%, its lifetime to 40 seconds (from 50 seconds) and its spawn time interval to 10 seconds (from 12.5 seconds).
2022
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Barbarian‘s attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.4 seconds).
*On 4/10/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(4/10/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarian Hut's cost to 6 [[Elixir]] (from 7 Elixir), and increased its spawn time interval to 14 seconds (from 10 seconds). It also made it so that 3 Barbarians will spawn per wave (from 2), decreased its lifetime to 30 seconds (from 40 seconds), and decreased the Barbarians spawned upon death to 1 (from 2).
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Barbarian Hut from Serenity Peak to Jungle Arena.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Barbarian Hut's hitpoints by 0.17%.

